# Keep the "app" (static) service surface clean and the deployment upload small.
# The "api" service (root: api/) is self-contained (stdlib only) and needs none
# of these. Experiment artifacts (benchmarks/, experiments/) are produced by
# local runs and are already git-ignored; the API degrades gracefully without them.

venv/
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
*.pyc

logs/
models/
data/raw/
data/processed/
notebooks/

src/
tests/
docs/
demo_stage*.py
run.py
local_server.py
*.md
.claude/
